      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Boris is an Italian comedy set behind the scenes of a chaotic Rome soap opera. On his first morning at the studio, the new intern Alessandro looks for the director Rene, who is busy pep-talking his lucky goldfish Boris before assistant director Arianna stops Alessandro in the hall. You will hear the whole scene in Italian first, so do not worry about catching every word.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
